{"originalLanguage":"ja","title":"완전감각 Dreamer","artist":"ONE OK ROCK","date":"2026-09-05","sourceId":"15051325:016","sourceHash":"f5a51785d8045a048cfd8c569d797351824faee480bca6fcefed1745d93c04ed","duration":196.6999999999989,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":34.839255,"end":37.215,"text":"So now my time is up","translation":"이제 내 시간은 끝났어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":37.449209,"end":38.634878,"text":"Your game starts,","translation":"네 게임이 시작돼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":38.769186,"end":40.089162,"text":"My heart moving?","translation":"내 심장이 뛰는 걸까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":40.109162,"end":43.666168,"text":"Past time has no meaning for us,","translation":"지나간 시간은 우리에게 의미 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":43.7091,"end":45.052857,"text":"It's not enough!","translation":"아직 부족해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":45.319071,"end":47.848498,"text":"Will we make it better","translation":"우린 더 낫게 만들까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":47.869027,"end":50.082275,"text":"Or just stand here longer","translation":"아니면 여기 더 오래 서 있을까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":50.118987,"end":51.146567,"text":"Say it,","translation":"말해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":51.288967,"end":55.241196,"text":"\"We can't end here till we can get it enough\"","translation":"충분히 얻을 때까지 여기서 끝낼 순 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":55.408895,"end":59.99348,"text":"絶対的根拠はウソだらけ","translation":"절대적 근거는 거짓투성이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":60.018814,"end":65.314801,"text":"いつだってあるのは僕の","translation":"언제나 있는 건 나의","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":65.368721,"end":70.025,"text":"自信や不安をかき混ぜた","translation":"자신감과 불안을 뒤섞은","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":70.258635,"end":75.238444,"text":"弱いようで強い僕","translation":"약한 듯 강한 나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":75.538543,"end":77.658506,"text":"This is my own judgement!!","translation":"이건 나 자신의 판단","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":77.678506,"end":79.575575,"text":"Got nothing to say!!","translation":"할 말 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id"